          IDENT  RTCLOCK,100B
          PERIPH
          ORG    100B
*         PP PROGRAM: REAL-TIME CLOCK AND EXTERNAL TEXT (XTEXT).
*
*         CHANNEL 14B IS CONNECTED TO THE CLOCK: IT IS ALWAYS ACTIVE
*         AND FULL; IAN 14B RETURNS THE TIME IN MICROSECONDS.
*         THE PP ACCUMULATES THE DIFFERENCES ON 24 BITS AND DISPLAYS
*         THE RESULT IN OCTAL IN LARGE CHARACTERS.
*         THE CONSOLE DEFINITIONS AND THE SHOW MACRO COME FROM THE
*         DEFS6612 TEXT (FILE DEFS6612.TXT OF THE WORKSPACE).
*
          XTEXT  DEFS6612
*
CHH       EQU    14B         CLOCK CHANNEL
PV        EQU    20B         LAST VALUE READ
HI        EQU    21B         ACCUMULATED TIME, UPPER 12 BITS
LO        EQU    22B         ACCUMULATED TIME, LOWER 12 BITS
T1        EQU    23B
T2        EQU    24B
T3        EQU    25B
*
START     LDN    0
          STD    HI
          STD    LO
          IAN    CHH
          STD    PV
*
*         ACCUMULATES THE TIME ELAPSED SINCE THE PREVIOUS READING
*
LOOP      IAN    CHH         CURRENT TIME
          STD    T1
          SBD    PV          DIFFERENCE = T - PV
          LPC    7777B       MODULO 4096
          ADD    LO
          STD    LO          LO = LO + DIFFERENCE (12 BITS)
          SHN    -12D        CARRY
          RAD    HI          HI = HI + CARRY
          LDD    T1
          STD    PV
*
*         FORMATTING: 8 OCTAL DIGITS IN THE DISPLAYED LINE
*
          LDD    HI
          SHN    -6
          RJM    OCT2
          STM    VALUE
          LDD    HI
          LPN    77B
          RJM    OCT2
          STM    VALUE+1
          LDD    LO
          SHN    -6
          RJM    OCT2
          STM    VALUE+2
          LDD    LO
          LPN    77B
          RJM    OCT2
          STM    VALUE+3
*
          SHOW   LMED,BANNER,BANNERL
          SHOW   LLARGE,LINE,LINEL
          SHOW   RMED,NOTE,NOTEL
          LJM    LOOP
*
*         OCT2: A = 6 BITS -> A = TWO OCTAL DIGITS IN DISPLAY CODE
*
OCT2X     LJM    *
OCT2      EQU    *-1
          STD    T2
          LPN    7
          STD    T3
          LDD    T2
          LPN    70B
          SHN    3
          ADD    T3
          ADC    3333B
          LJM    OCT2X
*
BANNER    CON    COORX+20B,COORY+700B
          DIS    15,REAL-TIME CLOCK (CHANNEL 14B)
BANNERL   EQU    *-BANNER
LINE      CON    COORX+200B,COORY+440B
VALUE     BSS    4           8 OCTAL DIGITS
LINEL     EQU    *-LINE
NOTE      CON    COORX+20B,COORY+500B
          DIS    7,MICROSECONDS
          CON    COORX+20B,COORY+440B
          DIS    9,SIMULATED (OCTAL)
NOTEL     EQU    *-NOTE
          END
